new file mode 100644
index 000000000..2a24db0c5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/docs/decisions/2863-edge-work.md
@@ -0,0 +1,19 @@
+## #2863 - A small plate for edge-work debugging
+
+**What was decided:** Add one original 60 x 40 x 6 mm plate with four
+existing command-driven operations. Chamfer and Deburr compare cone edge
+breaks. Engrave and Trace compare the same closed boundary at the same
+depth. The project embeds the mesh without an external model link.
+
+**Why:** A small reproducible fixture makes the posted paths easy to
+inspect and compare. One script builds, verifies, saves, and posts all
+four operations. The embedded mesh lets the project open from another
+working directory. This change adds no production code.
+
+**Considered and dropped:** Interior text and open strokes would require
+behavior beyond the closed boundaries that Engrave and Trace support.
+Separate cases would repeat the plate and script without making this
+small comparison easier to inspect.
+
+**Cost to change later:** Edit the fixture or script and regenerate its
+project and NC program. No production code change is required.
diff --git a/examples/catalog/2d/edge-work/README.md b/examples/catalog/2d/edge-work/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..5ca8cb18a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/examples/catalog/2d/edge-work/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@
+# Plate edge work
+
+This original 60 x 40 x 6 mm plate compares four closed edge operations.
+The stock is the finished plate. This case does not rough a blank.
+
+| Operation | Tool | Inspect |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Chamfer | 6 mm, 90 degree cone | A 0.8 mm wide chamfer on the top outline. |
+| Deburr | Same cone | A 0.3 mm edge break. The tip window excludes the bottom edges. |
+| Engrave | 6 mm end mill | A shallow closed perimeter mark at Z 5.8. |
+| Trace | Same end mill | The same closed path and depth as the engraved mark. |
+
+Engrave and Trace intentionally share the plate boundary. Compare their
+posted paths. They show closed perimeter marking, not text or open curves.
+Chamfer and Deburr also compare two edge treatments on the same model.
+These repeated cuts form a debugging example, not a production sequence.
+Deburr reports skipped vertical corner edges that the vertical cone cannot
+reach. This informational note leaves the top outline cut complete.
+
+Inspect the four operation sections in `edge-work.nc`. Each must contain
+cutting moves. Check the cone offsets and the shallow marking depth.
+The project embeds its original mesh and has no external model link.
+
+Regenerate the model with `python3 model/gen_edge_work_obj.py`.
+From the repository root, rebuild with
+`cargo xtask catalog --case 2d/edge-work`.
+Run `cargo xtask catalog --check` and
+`cargo test -p camcraft-app --test example_catalog` to check reproducibility.
diff --git a/examples/catalog/2d/edge-work/build.camscript b/examples/catalog/2d/edge-work/build.camscript
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..ec6cea7aa
--- /dev/null
+++ b/examples/catalog/2d/edge-work/build.camscript
@@ -0,0 +1,36 @@
+// Provenance: original plate edge-work example using CamCraft commands.
+cam.import("model/edge-work.obj", "edge-work");
+cam.call("set_model_link", { model: "edge-work", path: null });
+cam.call("set_stock", { from_model: "edge-work" });
+cam.call("add_tool", { catalog: "CM-0600-90", holder: "none" });
+cam.call("add_tool", { catalog: "EM-0600-4FL", holder: "none" });
+
+cam.call("add_operation", {
+  kind: "2D Chamfer", name: "Chamfer", tool: "CM-0600-90", source: "edge-work",
+  params: { width: 0.8, angle_deg: 45.0, clearance_z: 21.0,
+    top_z: 6.0, feed: 800.0, plunge_feed: 200.0, climb: true, side: "auto" }
+});
+cam.call("add_operation", {
+  kind: "Deburr", name: "Deburr", tool: "CM-0600-90", source: "edge-work",
+  // The window bounds the tip, 0.3 mm below the top edge for a 90 degree cone.
+  params: { width: 0.3, clearance_z: 21.0, top_z: 6.0, bottom_z: 5.0,
+    feed: 800.0, plunge_feed: 200.0 }
+});
+cam.call("add_operation", {
+  kind: "Engrave", name: "Engrave", tool: "EM-0600-4FL", source: "edge-work",
+  params: { clearance_z: 21.0, top_z: 6.0, bottom_z: 5.8,
+    stepdown: 1.0, feed: 600.0, plunge_feed: 150.0, climb: true }
+});
+cam.call("add_operation", {
+  kind: "Trace", name: "Trace", tool: "EM-0600-4FL", source: "edge-work",
+  params: { clearance_z: 21.0, top_z: 6.0, bottom_z: 5.8,
+    stepdown: 1.0, feed: 600.0, plunge_feed: 150.0, climb: true }
+});
+cam.generate();
+var verdict = cam.verify();
+if (!verdict.ok) {
+  throw new Error("catalog verify failed: " + JSON.stringify(verdict));
+}
+cam.save("edge-work.camproj");
+cam.post({ to: "edge-work.nc" });
+cam.report();
